            "value": "Harris-Lovett, S., Lienert, J., & Sedlak, D. (2019). A mixed-methods approach to strategic planning for multi-benefit regional water infrastructure. Journal of Environmental Management, 233, 218-237. http://doi.org/10.1016/j.jenvman.2018.11.112",
